              "sectionSpacing": 8,
              "source": "\u003cdiv style\u003d\"font-size:14.5px;color:#C9D2E0;line-height:1.55;padding:0 0 16px 0;\"\u003eOpen a basket into each cavity of the die mounted on this machine.\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"background-color:#172238;border-radius:6px;padding:14px;margin:0 0 12px 0;\"\u003e\u003ctable width\u003d\"100%\" cellpadding\u003d\"0\" cellspacing\u003d\"0\" border\u003d\"0\" style\u003d\"border-collapse:collapse;\"\u003e\u003ctr style\u003d\"border:none;\"\u003e\u003ctd width\u003d\"46\" valign\u003d\"top\" style\u003d\"border:none;background-color:#172238;\"\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:17px;background-color:#22A8CC;color:#0B1220;font-size:17px;font-weight:bold;text-align:center;line-height:34px;\"\u003e1\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd valign\u003d\"top\" style\u003d\"border:none;background-color:#172238;padding-top:2px;\"\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"font-size:15px;font-weight:bold;color:#F0F3F8;\"\u003eCheck the die\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"font-size:13.5px;color:#C9D2E0;padding-top:3px;line-height:1.5;\"\u003eThe \u003cspan style\u003d\"color:#F0F3F8;font-weight:bold;\"\u003eDie\u003c/span\u003e box at the top names the tool mounted on this machine, and the cavity rows below come from it. Every cavity of the die has a row, in the order they are numbered on the die.\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003c/table\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"background-color:#172238;border-radius:6px;padding:14px;margin:0 0 12px 0;\"\u003e\u003ctable width\u003d\"100%\" cellpadding\u003d\"0\" cellspacing\u003d\"0\" border\u003d\"0\" style\u003d\"border-collapse:collapse;\"\u003e\u003ctr style\u003d\"border:none;\"\u003e\u003ctd width\u003d\"46\" valign\u003d\"top\" style\u003d\"border:none;background-color:#172238;\"\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:17px;background-color:#22A8CC;color:#0B1220;font-size:17px;font-weight:bold;text-align:center;line-height:34px;\"\u003e2\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd valign\u003d\"top\" style\u003d\"border:none;background-color:#172238;padding-top:2px;\"\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"font-size:15px;font-weight:bold;color:#F0F3F8;\"\u003eCheck the part\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"font-size:13.5px;color:#C9D2E0;padding-top:3px;line-height:1.5;\"\u003eEach row already shows the \u003cspan style\u003d\"color:#F0F3F8;font-weight:bold;\"\u003ePart\u003c/span\u003e that cavity is set up to cast. You do not pick it \u0026ndash; it comes from the die\u0027s configuration, and the box is locked so a basket cannot be opened against the wrong part.\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003c/table\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"font-size:12.5px;color:#9AA8BF;font-style:italic;padding:2px 0 14px 46px;line-height:1.5;\"\u003eA cavity that has never been set up shows an open \u003cspan style\u003d\"color:#F0F3F8;font-weight:bold;\"\u003ePart\u003c/span\u003e box. Pick the part, then tell a supervisor so the die gets configured properly.\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"background-color:#172238;border-radius:6px;padding:14px;margin:0 0 12px 0;\"\u003e\u003ctable width\u003d\"100%\" cellpadding\u003d\"0\" cellspacing\u003d\"0\" border\u003d\"0\" style\u003d\"border-collapse:collapse;\"\u003e\u003ctr style\u003d\"border:none;\"\u003e\u003ctd width\u003d\"46\" valign\u003d\"top\" style\u003d\"border:none;background-color:#172238;\"\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:17px;background-color:#22A8CC;color:#0B1220;font-size:17px;font-weight:bold;text-align:center;line-height:34px;\"\u003e3\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd valign\u003d\"top\" style\u003d\"border:none;background-color:#172238;padding-top:2px;\"\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"font-size:15px;font-weight:bold;color:#F0F3F8;\"\u003eScan the basket\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"font-size:13.5px;color:#C9D2E0;padding-top:3px;line-height:1.5;\"\u003eScan the \u003cspan style\u003d\"color:#F0F3F8;font-weight:bold;\"\u003eLTT Barcode\u003c/span\u003e from the basket into that row. Scanning the ticket is what stages the row \u0026ndash; the button at the bottom counts the tickets you have scanned, nothing else.\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003c/table\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"background-color:#172238;border-radius:6px;padding:14px;margin:0 0 12px 0;\"\u003e\u003ctable width\u003d\"100%\" cellpadding\u003d\"0\" cellspacing\u003d\"0\" border\u003d\"0\" style\u003d\"border-collapse:collapse;\"\u003e\u003ctr style\u003d\"border:none;\"\u003e\u003ctd width\u003d\"46\" valign\u003d\"top\" style\u003d\"border:none;background-color:#172238;\"\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:17px;background-color:#22A8CC;color:#0B1220;font-size:17px;font-weight:bold;text-align:center;line-height:34px;\"\u003e4\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd valign\u003d\"top\" style\u003d\"border:none;background-color:#172238;padding-top:2px;\"\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"font-size:15px;font-weight:bold;color:#F0F3F8;\"\u003eOpen them\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"font-size:13.5px;color:#C9D2E0;padding-top:3px;line-height:1.5;\"\u003ePress the button at the bottom. It counts the tickets you have scanned \u0026ndash; \u003cspan style\u003d\"color:#F0F3F8;font-weight:bold;\"\u003eOPEN 3 BASKET(S)\u003c/span\u003e means three rows are staged. Every one of them is opened at once. It stays greyed out until you have scanned at least one ticket.\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003c/table\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"border-top:1px solid #172238;margin:2px 0 16px 0;\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"background-color:#172238;border-radius:6px;padding:14px;margin:0 0 12px 0;\"\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.03em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#9AA8BF;padding-bottom:8px;\"\u003eROWS THAT OFFER NOTHING\u003c/div\u003e\u003ctable width\u003d\"100%\" cellpadding\u003d\"0\" cellspacing\u003d\"0\" border\u003d\"0\" style\u003d\"border-collapse:collapse;\"\u003e\u003ctr style\u003d\"border:none;\"\u003e\u003ctd width\u003d\"18\" valign\u003d\"top\" style\u003d\"border:none;background-color:#172238;color:#22A8CC;font-size:15px;font-weight:bold;padding-bottom:10px;\"\u003e\u0026bull;\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd valign\u003d\"top\" style\u003d\"border:none;background-color:#172238;padding-bottom:10px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\"font-size:13.5px;font-weight:bold;color:#F0F3F8;\"\u003eAlready open\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\"font-size:13.5px;color:#C9D2E0;line-height:1.5;\"\u003e \u0026ndash; The cavity is holding a basket. Release it on the \u003cspan style\u003d\"color:#F0F3F8;font-weight:bold;\"\u003eLot Release\u003c/span\u003e tab before opening another.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr style\u003d\"border:none;\"\u003e\u003ctd width\u003d\"18\" valign\u003d\"top\" style\u003d\"border:none;background-color:#172238;color:#22A8CC;font-size:15px;font-weight:bold;padding-bottom:10px;\"\u003e\u0026bull;\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd valign\u003d\"top\" style\u003d\"border:none;background-color:#172238;padding-bottom:10px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\"font-size:13.5px;font-weight:bold;color:#F0F3F8;\"\u003eOut of service\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\"font-size:13.5px;color:#C9D2E0;line-height:1.5;\"\u003e \u0026ndash; The cavity is Closed or Scrapped in the die\u0027s configuration. It still runs shots, and they still get recorded as scrap on \u003cspan style\u003d\"color:#F0F3F8;font-weight:bold;\"\u003eRecord Shift Output\u003c/span\u003e \u0026ndash; it just cannot hold a basket.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003c/table\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"background-color:#172238;border-radius:6px;padding:14px;margin:0 0 12px 0;\"\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.03em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#9AA8BF;padding-bottom:8px;\"\u003eTHE OTHER BUTTONS\u003c/div\u003e\u003ctable width\u003d\"100%\" cellpadding\u003d\"0\" cellspacing\u003d\"0\" border\u003d\"0\" style\u003d\"border-collapse:collapse;\"\u003e\u003ctr style\u003d\"border:none;\"\u003e\u003ctd width\u003d\"18\" valign\u003d\"top\" style\u003d\"border:none;background-color:#172238;color:#22A8CC;font-size:15px;font-weight:bold;padding-bottom:10px;\"\u003e\u0026bull;\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd valign\u003d\"top\" style\u003d\"border:none;background-color:#172238;padding-bottom:10px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\"font-size:13.5px;font-weight:bold;color:#F0F3F8;\"\u003eCopy part to empty rows\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\"font-size:13.5px;color:#C9D2E0;line-height:1.5;\"\u003e \u0026ndash; Only on a die whose cavities cast more than one part. Fills the \u003cspan style\u003d\"color:#F0F3F8;font-weight:bold;\"\u003ePart\u003c/span\u003e box on every row you have not set yet with the part from the first row you did.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr style\u003d\"border:none;\"\u003e\u003ctd width\u003d\"18\" valign\u003d\"top\" style\u003d\"border:none;background-color:#172238;color:#22A8CC;font-size:15px;font-weight:bold;padding-bottom:10px;\"\u003e\u0026bull;\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd valign\u003d\"top\" style\u003d\"border:none;background-color:#172238;padding-bottom:10px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\"font-size:13.5px;font-weight:bold;color:#F0F3F8;\"\u003eClear\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\"font-size:13.5px;color:#C9D2E0;line-height:1.5;\"\u003e \u0026ndash; Empties every scanned ticket and part on the grid. Nothing is opened, and nothing already open is touched.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr style\u003d\"border:none;\"\u003e\u003ctd width\u003d\"18\" valign\u003d\"top\" style\u003d\"border:none;background-color:#172238;color:#22A8CC;font-size:15px;font-weight:bold;padding-bottom:10px;\"\u003e\u0026bull;\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd valign\u003d\"top\" style\u003d\"border:none;background-color:#172238;padding-bottom:10px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\"font-size:13.5px;font-weight:bold;color:#F0F3F8;\"\u003eTool Config\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\"font-size:13.5px;color:#C9D2E0;line-height:1.5;\"\u003e \u0026ndash; Opens the die\u0027s configuration. Greyed out until a supervisor signs in with their own credentials at the terminal.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003c/table\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"background-color:#3A2E10;border-left:5px solid #F4B343;border-radius:4px;padding:12px 14px;margin:4px 0 16px 0;\"\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"font-size:14px;font-weight:bold;color:#F0F3F8;padding-bottom:4px;\"\u003eIf the die is wrong\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style\u003d\"font-size:13.5px;color:#C9D2E0;line-height:1.5;\"\u003eIf it is empty or names a different die, stop and tell a supervisor \u0026ndash; do not work around it.\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e",
              "style": {
                "fontSize": 13,
                "overflow": "auto"
              }
            },
            "type": "ia.display.markdown"
          }
        ],
